{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsKnots.RamifiedDiscFusion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.RamifiedDiscFusion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.resolvent_agreement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.resolvent_agreement","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsKnots/RamifiedDiscFusion.lean#L45-L68","doc":"**Proposition (`prop:ramified-disc-fusion`).**\nThe cyclic monodromy generator $(rgb)$ acts on the Lagrange\nresolvent $w_k$ by multiplication by $\\zeta^{-1}$. This exhibits\nthe explicit geometric agreement of the $S_3$ action with the\nLagrange-resolvent action, satisfying the third claim of the\nnarrative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.resolvent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.resolvent","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsKnots/RamifiedDiscFusion.lean#L39-L43","doc":"The Lagrange resolvents $w_k$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.cyclic_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.cyclic_perm","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsKnots/RamifiedDiscFusion.lean#L36-L37","doc":"The cyclic monodromy generator (rgb). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.galois_group_order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.galois_group_order","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsKnots/RamifiedDiscFusion.lean#L32-L34","doc":"Order of the Galois group is 6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.S3","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsKnots/RamifiedDiscFusion.lean#L29-L30","doc":"The Galois group $S_3$ acting on the three color sectors. ","signatureChunk":0}]}